<div class="section_content content" id="7686341_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The City Clerk is hereby authorized and directed to cause copies of this article to be posted in three (3) prominent places in the City and to cause publication once in the official newspaper of the City of a notice setting forth the date of adoption, the title of this article and a list of places where copies of this article are posted within fifteen (15) days after the adoption of this article.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
